window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Everyone is a stranger at some point, right? Pulled by an explicable, undeniable thread of...something...</p> <p>Nick and Noah find themselves keen on becoming more. Hashtags and flights, and late-night text sessions lead to a connection neither has experienced, or expected. Beyond the shiny veneer of social media, further than the shallow depths of a good selfie, down to the real, for real stuff that relationships are made of...</p> <p>Can Nick and Noah actually reach their prematurely awarded goal?</p>"; 
